:: Temple Library
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<temple_effects>><<effects>>

<<if $malechance is 100>>Monks<<elseif $malechance is 0>>Nuns<<else>>Monks and nuns<</if>> study in the library, looking for books in the vast shelves or reading at the various tables.

<<if isPlayerNonparasitePregnancyEnding() and !$possessed>>
	<<pregnancyPassout "temple">>
<<elseif $stress gte $stressmax>>
	<<passouttemple>>
<<elseif $exposed gte 1>>
    You creep around the library, concealing your nudity behind a column of gargoyles whenever you hear the shuffle of feet.
    <br><br>
    <<link [[Cloister (0:01)|Temple Cloister]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
    <br>
<<else>>
    
<</if>>